                  <msItem>
                     <title>Biblia</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Writings above top line; a--g chapter division
                        for Genesis and Matthew only; includes Psalms. Hebrew names at end. At end
                        of Apocalypse, in red: 'Hic explicit bibliotheca. Vitam scriptoris servet
                        mater genitoris / Vitam scriptori det deus absque mori.' 2o fo.: 'in libro
                        nesciens'. Verses added at end (Walther, no. 18224).</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Known as the Tarquair Bible from early modern
                        and present ownership.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
